  "notes": "Modified cash basis governmental funds; enterprise funds on accrual basis (business_type measure net position). Governmental lines from the Total Governmental Funds column (p5); beginning/ending fund balance 1,318,411 / 1,498,198 (p5). No governmental beginning cash printed; ending cash from the governmental funds balance sheet (p4): cash and cash equivalents 1,489,587 (incl. restricted 662,469 on p1) + county treasurer 5,344; CDs 3,546 in ending_investments. Balance sheet from the government-wide Statement of Net Position (p1; includes capital assets and debt, so it differs from the funds balance sheet). Statement capital outlay 35,879 has no printed function. Business-type: receipts = operating revenues 292,138 + interest income 819; 'Other revenue' 4,479 counted in Charges for Services on the Statement of Activities; disbursements 389,111 as printed on p2 (operating 344,988 + interest 43,723 + bond fees 400); transfers from other funds 40,004. Proprietary cash flows from p8 Total column. Detail: General Fund from the departmental combining statement (p13), which supersedes the General Fund budget schedule (p9); Street, Community Development and CDA funds from their budget schedules (pp10-12; zero-actual CD lines General government and Capital outlay not recorded). Debt Service Fund (property 4, transfer out 4) and the Water/Sewer funds have no supplementary schedules. Read pages 1-13 of 13"
